    "title": "A Measurement of the Branching Fractions of Exclusive $\\bar{B} \\to D^{(*)}(\\pi)\\ell^{-}\\bar{\\nu}_{\\ell}$ Decays in Events with a Fully Reconstructed $B$ Meson",
    "arxiv": "[0712.3503v1](https://arxiv.org/pdf/0712.3503)",
    "time": "2007.12.20",
    "abstract": "We report a measurement of the branching fractions for $\\bar{B} \\to D^{(*)}(\\pi)\\ell^{-}\\bar{\\nu}_{\\ell}$ decays based on 341.1 fb$^{-1}$ of data collected at the $\\Upsilon(4S)$ resonance with the BaBar detector at the PEP-II $e^{+}e^{-}$ storage rings. Events are tagged by fully reconstructing one of the $B$ mesons in a hadronic decay mode. We measure the branching fractions relative to the inclusive semileptonic branching fraction.",
